Troubleshooting checklist (short):
- Ensure every awaited async call is inside a try/catch or the returned promise is handled.
- Log full stack traces (Winston) and correlate with timestamps.
- Add process.on('unhandledRejection') and process.on('uncaughtException') during deployment.
- For HTTP handlers, return after res.send / res.status(...) to avoid double responses.
- For sockets, emit an error event to the client so the UI can react.
- Use batching/Promise.all for bulk operations and handle aggregate failures.
- If notifications fail, ensure the error is still logged (don’t let notification failures hide the original error).

